{"id":212,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Evolved by way of a curious item. The shell covering its body has been shown to be stronger than forged steel."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Though its body is slim, Scizor has tremendous attacking power. Even Scizor’s muscles are made of metal."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Bulky pincers account for one third of Scizor’s body weight. A single swing of one of these pincers will crush a boulder completely."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Once it has identified something as an enemy, it will continue beating them with its steel-hard pincers until there’s nothing left but scraps."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its body is like steel. Its tough, heavy pincers are more suited to smashing enemies than grabbing them."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Once it has identified an enemy, this Pokémon smashes it mercilessly with pincers hard as steel."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It uses its wings to adjust its body temperature. Otherwise, its metal body would become too hot and melt in the heat of battle."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Scizor has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This Pokémon flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"games":["Y","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"This Pokémon’s pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object it gets ahold of into bits."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Its wings are not used for flying. They are flapped at high speed to adjust its body temperature."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It swings its eye-patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. It flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Swarm","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Bug-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Technician","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up weak moves so the Pokémon can deal more damage with them."},{"name":"Light Metal","hidden":true,"description":"Halves the Pokémon's weight."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Red","shape":"Bug wings","evolution":{"id":123,"name":"Scyther","condition":null,"children":[{"id":212,"name":"Scizor","condition":"Trade, holding Metal Coat","children":[]},{"id":900,"name":"Kleavor","condition":"Use Black Augurite","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,418],[1,17],[1,43],[1,97],[1,98],[1,206],[1,210],[1,403],[12,232],[16,104],[20,458],[24,163],[28,116],[32,334],[36,442],[40,404],[44,14]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,226,280,450,405,370,174,38,814,203,263,206,430,374,416,912,270,63,334,442,282,113,679,232,884,182,240,156,179,201,184,806,214,796,522,164,241,129,14,366,36,851,168,885,369,410,404],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3-205","name":"Scizor","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"205","artist":"Oku","img":"sv3/205"},{"id":"me55c-108","name":"Scizor ex","set":"30th Celebration: Classic Collection","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Rare Holo ex","number":"108","artist":"Mitsuhiro Arita","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55c-108/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55c-108/large"},{"id":"sv5-111","name":"Scizor ex","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"111","artist":"toriyufu","img":"sv5/111"},{"id":"sv5-195","name":"Scizor ex","set":"Temporal Forces","date"